      "title": "My latest books cartoon for the @guardian ",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/bde754f58d92fb6d03714103f6bcbf1d/b5c584da708426e2-04/s640x960/27863ec58631f7d966b31dcfd4eeb77f706b4280.jpg\" data-orig-height=\"834\" data-orig-width=\"1500\" alt=\" Panel 1 A knight in armour addresses a woman (also armoured) with long purple hair &quot;Dear lady! Your beauty has captured my heart! May I beg permission to dedicate a poem to you?  She replies &quot;Is this your first time in a romantasy novel?&quot;  Panel 2 He Answers &quot;Indeed, though I am well schooled in the ways of the chivalric romance.&quot; She explains &quot;It's a similar 'Swords and Sorcery' vibe, but a bit less &quot;reserved&quot;.&quot;  Panel 3 He asks &quot;Ah. So we move straight to taking a stroll together?&quot; continues &quot;With no chaperone?!&quot;  and continues, more andmore shocked &quot;In a secluded glade!?&quot;  and finally &quot;Heavens, madam! Surely I may not take a lock of your hair before betrothal!!!&quot;  Panel 4 Caption: Later The knight is dazed and confused, his face red. He thinks to himself &quot;Lord, what a strange new world.&quot;\" srcset=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/bde754f58d92fb6d03714103f6bcbf1d/b5c584da708426e2-04/s75x75_c1/e3f167b98552b68cc96018f3c391ba9a9b490380.jpg 75w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/bde754f58d92fb6d03714103f6bcbf1d/b5c584da708426e2-04/s100x200/561240e04f527f0680808758199b0c18b9795b25.jpg 100w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/bde754f58d92fb6d03714103f6bcbf1d/b5c584da708426e2-04/s250x400/0156115a9faeb7280ddfa42d38b7d354b67c101c.jpg 250w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/bde754f58d92fb6d03714103f6bcbf1d/b5c584da708426e2-04/s400x600/c0ed152af0212e54e3d99a5fd681bc27d0721f59.jpg 400w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/bde754f58d92fb6d03714103f6bcbf1d/b5c584da708426e2-04/s500x750/5ad7fd768749eb29e4230564924b63dbadca101f.jpg 500w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/bde754f58d92fb6d03714103f6bcbf1d/b5c584da708426e2-04/s540x810/c51f3120d2110acfb71adfd34b9a26a2606a73b5.jpg 540w, https://64.media.t